#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Quantum resource management interface (QRMI) {#quantum-resource-management-"
"interface-qrmi}"
msgstr ""
"Antarmuka manajemen sumber daya kuantum (QRMI) {#quantum-resource-"
"management-interface-qrmi}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Quantum resource management interface (QRMI) is a vendor-agnostic "
"library for high-performance compute (HPC) systems to access, control, and "
"monitor the behavior of quantum computational resources. It acts as a thin "
"middleware layer that abstracts away the complexities associated with "
"controlling quantum resources through a set of simple APIs. Written in Rust,"
" this interface also exposes Python and C APIs for ease of integration into "
"nearly any computational environment.\n"
msgstr ""
"Antarmuka manajemen sumber daya kuantum (QRMI) adalah library yang tidak "
"bergantung pada vendor, dirancang untuk sistem komputasi berkinerja tinggi "
"(HPC) agar bisa mengakses, mengontrol, dan memantau perilaku sumber daya "
"komputasi kuantum. Library ini berfungsi sebagai lapisan middleware tipis "
"yang menyembunyikan kompleksitas pengendalian sumber daya kuantum melalui "
"sekumpulan API sederhana. Ditulis dalam Rust, antarmuka ini juga mengekspos "
"API Python dan C agar mudah diintegrasikan ke hampir semua lingkungan "
"komputasi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Find the source code to build and deploy QRMI in this [GitHub "
"repository](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qrmi).\n"
msgstr ""
"Temukan kode sumber untuk membangun dan mendeploy QRMI di [repositori "
"GitHub](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qrmi) ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An optional `task_runner` command line tool to execute quantum payloads "
"against quantum hardware is included in the Python package. Find the [full "
"documentation](https://github.com/qiskit-"
"community/qrmi/blob/main/python/qrmi/tools/task_runner/README.md) in the "
"GitHub repository.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tool baris perintah opsional `task_runner` untuk mengeksekusi payload "
"kuantum terhadap hardware kuantum disertakan dalam paket Python. Temukan "
"[dokumentasi lengkapnya](https://github.com/qiskit-"
"community/qrmi/blob/main/python/qrmi/tools/task_runner/README.md) di "
"repositori GitHub.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Build the QRMI libraries {#build-the-qrmi-libraries}"
msgstr "Membangun library QRMI {#build-the-qrmi-libraries}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "This section shows how to build QRMI for C and Python.\n"
msgstr "Bagian ini menjelaskan cara membangun QRMI untuk C dan Python.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements {#requirements}"
msgstr "Persyaratan {#requirements}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "QRMI supports the following operating systems (OS): \n"
msgstr "QRMI mendukung sistem operasi (OS) berikut:\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Compiling environment {#compiling-environment}"
msgstr "Lingkungan kompilasi {#compiling-environment}"

#. type: Bullet: '*  '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "[Rust compiler](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) 1.91 or above\n"
msgstr ""
"[Rust compiler](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) versi 1.91 atau "
"lebih baru\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A C compiler: for example, GCC (`gcc`) on Linux and Clang (`clang-tools-"
"extra`) for Rust unknown targets/cross compilations. QRMI is compatible with"
" a compiler conforming to the C11 standard\n"
msgstr ""
"Compiler C: misalnya, GCC (`gcc`) di Linux dan Clang (`clang-tools-extra`) "
"untuk target Rust yang tidak dikenal/kompilasi silang. QRMI kompatibel "
"dengan compiler yang sesuai standar C11\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`make/cmake` (make/cmake RPM for RHEL-compatible OS)\n"
msgstr "`make/cmake` (make/cmake RPM untuk OS kompatibel RHEL)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`openssl` (openssl-devel RPM for RHEL-compatible OS)\n"
msgstr "`openssl` (openssl-devel RPM untuk OS kompatibel RHEL)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "`zlib` (zlib-devel RPM for RHEL-compatible OS)\n"
msgstr "`zlib` (zlib-devel RPM untuk OS kompatibel RHEL)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Python 3.11, 3.12, or 3.13 (For Python API)\n"
msgstr "Python 3.11, 3.12, atau 3.13 (untuk API Python)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Libraries and header files needed for Python development (python3.1x-devel "
"RPM for RHEL-compatible OS):\n"
msgstr ""
"Library dan file header yang diperlukan untuk pengembangan Python "
"(python3.1x-devel RPM untuk OS kompatibel RHEL):\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/include/python3.1x\n"
msgstr "/usr/include/python3.1x\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/lib64/libpython3.1x.so\n"
msgstr "/usr/lib64/libpython3.1x.so\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Doxygen (for generating C API documentation), depending on the OS:\n"
msgstr "Doxygen (untuk menghasilkan dokumentasi C API), tergantung OS:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"```dnf install doxygen``` for Linux (RHEL/CentOS/Rocky Linux and others)\n"
msgstr ""
"```dnf install doxygen``` untuk Linux (RHEL/CentOS/Rocky Linux dan "
"lainnya)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "```apt install doxygen``` for Linux (Ubuntu and others)\n"
msgstr "```apt install doxygen``` untuk Linux (Ubuntu dan lainnya)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '  * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "```brew install doxygen```for MacOS\n"
msgstr "```brew install doxygen```untuk MacOS\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Runtime environment {#runtime-environment}"
msgstr "Lingkungan runtime {#runtime-environment}"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "gcc (libgcc RPM for RHEL-compatible OS)\n"
msgstr "gcc (libgcc RPM untuk OS kompatibel RHEL)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "openssl (openssl-libs RPM for RHEL-compatible OS)\n"
msgstr "openssl (openssl-libs RPM untuk OS kompatibel RHEL)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "zlib (zlib RPM for RHEL-compatible OS)\n"
msgstr "zlib (zlib RPM untuk OS kompatibel RHEL)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    * '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Libraries and header files needed for Python development (python3.1x-devel "
"RPM for RHEL-compatible OS)\n"
msgstr ""
"Library dan file header yang diperlukan untuk pengembangan Python "
"(python3.1x-devel RPM untuk OS kompatibel RHEL)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Build the Rust/C API library with the following commands wherever you have "
"saved the QRMI repository.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bangun library Rust/C API dengan perintah berikut di lokasi tempat kamu "
"menyimpan repositori QRMI.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To build the Python package, first set up a Python environment and install "
"the required dependencies.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk membangun paket Python, pertama siapkan lingkungan Python dan install "
"dependensi yang diperlukan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Create the stub files for the Python code.\n"
msgstr "Buat file stub untuk kode Python.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Lastly, build the Python wheels for distribution to your hosts.\n"
msgstr "Terakhir, bangun wheel Python untuk didistribusikan ke host-mu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The wheel is created in the `./target/release/maturin/wheels` directory. You"
" can distribute and install on your hosts by `pip install <wheel>`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Wheel dibuat di direktori `./target/release/maturin/wheels`. Kamu bisa "
"mendistribusikan dan menginstallnya di host-mu dengan `pip install "
"<wheel>`.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Logging {#logging}"
msgstr "Logging {#logging}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"QRMI supports [log crate](https://crates.io/crates/log) for logging. You can"
" find the detailed QRMI runtime logs by specifying `RUST_LOG` environment "
"variable with the log level. Supported levels are `error`, `warn`, `info`, "
"`debug`, and `trace`. The default level is `warn`. \n"
msgstr ""
"QRMI mendukung [log crate](https://crates.io/crates/log) untuk logging. Kamu"
" bisa menemukan log runtime QRMI yang detail dengan menentukan variabel "
"lingkungan `RUST_LOG` beserta level log-nya. Level yang didukung adalah "
"`error`, `warn`, `info`, `debug`, dan `trace`. Level default-nya adalah "
"`warn`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "If you specify `trace`, you can find underlying HTTP transaction logs.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika kamu menentukan `trace`, kamu bisa menemukan log transaksi HTTP yang "
"mendasarinya.\n"

